<li><time datetime="2026-05-12">May 12</time><span><a href="https://thehackernews.com/2026/05/rubygems-suspends-new-signups-after.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RubyGems disables new user registration</a>, describing the traffic as an ongoing DDoS</span></li>
